&lt;p&gt;At the behest of O5-3, and in light of recent events, new objectives have been added to AURUM SILKWORM guidance documents:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Assessing resistance to amnestics and memetic agents among test subjects.&lt;br /&gt;
